ty Recognition by Virtual Assistants"],"published":"2020-05-26","authors":["Christophe Van Gysel","Manos Tsagkias","Ernest Pusateri","Ilya Oparin"],"abstract":"We focus on improving the effectiveness of a Virtual Assistant (VA) in recognizing emerging entities in spoken queries. We introduce a method that uses historical user interactions to forecast which entities will gain in popularity and become trending, and it subsequently integrates the predictions within the Automated Speech Recognition (ASR) component of the VA. Experiments show that our proposed approach results in a 20% relative reduction in...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/predicting-entity-popularity-to-improve-spoken-entity-recognition-by-virtual-assistants","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["speech recognition"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:fg3jenefnecmwuhsv0xib6bo","title":"Robust Multichannel Linear Prediction for Online Speech Dereverberation Using Weighted Householder Least Squares Lattice Adaptive Filter","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/robust-multichannel-linear-prediction","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/robust-multichannel-linear-prediction"],"alternate_titles":["Robust Multichannel Linear Prediction for Online Speech Dereverberation Using Weighted Householder Least Squares Lattice Adaptive Filter"],"published":"2020-05-25","authors":["Jason Wung","Ante Jukić","Sarmad Malik","Mehrez Souden","Ramin Pichevar","Joshua Atkins","Devang Naik","Alex Acero"],"abstract":"Speech dereverberation has been an important component of effective far-field voice interfaces in many applications. Algorithms based on multichannel linear prediction (MCLP) have been shown to be especially effective for blind speech dereverberation and numerous variants have been introduced in the literature. Most of these approaches can be derived from a common framework, where the MCLP problem for speech dereverberation is formulated as a...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/robust-multichannel-linear-prediction","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":[],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:y6cqqtig4sroyq7i46t09khz","title":"Scalable Multilingual Frontend for TTS","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/scalable-multilingual-frontend-tts","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/scalable-multilingual-frontend-tts"],"alternate_titles":["Scalable Multilingual Frontend for TTS"],"published":"2020-05-10","authors":["Alistair Conkie","Andrew Finch"],"abstract":"This paper describes progress towards making a Neural Text-to-Speech (TTS) Frontend that works for many languages and can be easily extended to new languages. We take a Machine Translation (MT) inspired approach to constructing the frontend, and model both text normalization and pronunciation on a sentence level by building and using sequence-to-sequence (S2S) models. We experimented with training normalization and pronunciation as separate S2S...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/scalable-multilingual-frontend-tts","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["text-to-speech","neural"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"official:b1cb7a731af9f3a6","title":"AI and efficiency","url":"https://openai.com/index/ai-and-efficiency","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://openai.com/index/ai-and-efficiency"],"alternate_titles":["AI and efficiency"],"published":"2020-05-05","authors":["OpenAI"],"abstract":"We’re releasing an analysis showing that since 2012 the amount of compute needed to train a neural net to the same performance on ImageNet classification has been decreasing by a factor of 2 every 16 months. Compared to 2012, it now takes 44 times less compute to train a neural network to the level of AlexNet (by contrast, Moore’s Law would yield an 11x cost improvement over this period). Our results suggest that for AI tasks with high levels of recent investment, algorithmic progress has yielded more gains than classical hardware efficiency.","companies":["OpenAI"],"matched_orgs":["OpenAI"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"research_post","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":56,"matched_keywords":["Research"],"author_affiliations":["OpenAI"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official RSS feed https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://openai.com/index/ai-and-efficiency","labs":["OpenAI"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official RSS feed https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://openai.com/news/rss.xml","matched_terms":["neural network","AI","neural"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"research_post"},"ai_research_source":"https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"},{"id":"apple:g34srseamw2cxccpdtpphzz1","title":"Learning to Rank Intents in Voice Assistants","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/learning-to-rank-intents-in-voice-assistants","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/learning-to-rank-intents-in-voice-assistants"],"alternate_titles":["Learning to Rank Intents in Voice Assistants"],"published":"2020-05-04","authors":["Raviteja Anantha","Srinivas Chappidi","Arash William Dawoodi"],"abstract":"Voice assistants aim to fulfill user requests by choosing the best intent from multiple options generated by its Automated Speech Recognition and Natural Language Understanding sub-systems. However, voice assistants do not always produce the expected results. This can happen because voice assistants choose from ambiguous intents. User-specific or domain-specific contextual information can reduce the ambiguity of the user request. Additionally,...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/learning-to-rank-intents-in-voice-assistants","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["speech recognition","natural language"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:ji9m216ijkp50fyrbf7kb557","title":"Generalized Reinforcement Meta Learning for Few-Shot Optimization","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/generalized-reinforcement-meta-learning-few-shot-optimization","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/generalized-reinforcement-meta-learning-few-shot-optimization"],"alternate_titles":["Generalized Reinforcement Meta Learning for Few-Shot Optimization"],"published":"2020-05-04","authors":["Raviteja Anantha","Stephen Pulman","Srinivas Chappidi"],"abstract":"We present a generic and flexible Reinforcement Learning (RL) based meta-learning framework for the problem of few-shot learning. During training, it learns the best optimization algorithm to produce a learner (ranker/classifier, etc) by exploiting stable patterns in loss surfaces. Our method implicitly estimates the gradients of a scaled loss function while retaining the general properties intact for parameter updates. Besides providing improved...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/generalized-reinforcement-meta-learning-few-shot-optimization","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["reinforcement learning"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:gf0tiaq2dpglk9d4iufp3wlk","title":"Lattice-based Improvements for Voice Triggering Using Graph Neural Networks","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/lattice-based-improvements-for-voice-triggering","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/lattice-based-improvements-for-voice-triggering"],"alternate_titles":["Lattice-based Improvements for Voice Triggering Using Graph Neural Networks"],"published":"2020-05-01","authors":["Pranay DigheSaurabh AdyaNuoyu LiSrikanth VishnubhotlaDevang NaikAdithya SagarYing MaStephen PulmanJason D. Williams"],"abstract":"Voice-triggered smart assistants often rely on detection of a trigger-phrase before they start listening for the user request. Mitigation of false triggers is an important aspect of building a privacy-centric non-intrusive smart assistant. In this paper, we address the task of false trigger mitigation (FTM) using a novel approach based on analyzing automatic speech recognition (ASR) lattices using graph neural networks (GNN). The proposed...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/lattice-based-improvements-for-voice-triggering","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["speech recognition","neural networks","neural"],"concept_ids":[],"work_ty